{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Every year thousands of people move to Dubai thinking real estate will change their life. Most of them quit within six months. Not because they are lazy, but because nobody explains what the industry looks like after you land.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"}], "text": "Most people who move to Dubai for a real estate career quit within six months, not because they are lazy, but because they are not prepared for the realities of the industry."}, "title": "Challenges of Dubai real estate", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:d3ab454f4be1a210", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Challenges of Dubai real estate", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "But realistically, can you make twenty or thirty thousand dollars a month? Yes, you can. Only if you survive the first trap, an agency hiring system.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"}], "text": "Realistically, you can earn twenty or thirty thousand dollars a month in Dubai real estate only if you survive the initial challenges."}, "title": "Initial earnings potential", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:a4d9359354b744f1", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Initial earnings potential", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you will go with a big brand, like 100 plus agent, there is a chance that you will get a very standard onboarding.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000003"}, {"quote": "Well, a small boutique agency will give you probably what I call train as you go on board.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000004"}], "text": "Big brand agencies might provide a standard onboarding process, while smaller agencies may offer a 'train as you go' approach."}, "title": "Agency onboarding processes", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:efa71883301c25f0", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Agency onboarding processes", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I call it a Hoover. You may think if they selected me, it means they believe I can make it. So I really have a strong chance, but this is the first illusion.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"}], "text": "The speaker refers to the agency hiring system as a 'Hoover', suggesting it gives false hope to candidates about their potential for success."}, "title": "First trap of agency hiring", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:ce6fa3458b507e35", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "First trap of agency hiring", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"], "exceptions": [{"citations": [{"quote": "It doesn't mean that you will not be able to make it, but you should have at least three months tourist visa to survive that period.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"}], "text": "Having at least a three-month tourist visa can help survive the initial period without a residency visa."}], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "When my residency visa will be processed... Majority of the companies will respond after your first deal is closed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}], "text": "The processing of a residency visa can put real estate agents in a vulnerable position if it's delayed until after their first deal is closed."}, "title": "Impact of visa processing on agents", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:01ae8c110ee7379b", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Impact of visa processing on agents", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "And if the answer is more than ten, then your manager will be able to dedicate just thirty minutes a week. It's not enough for you if you just started.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"}], "text": "If more than ten agents are in one team, manager may only give thirty minutes weekly; not enough for new agents."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "When will I get my RERA certification?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"}], "text": "Real estate work necessitates knowledge of the RERA certification process."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "So, let's make you the fittest.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}], "text": "To make oneself the fittest for surviving in the real estate industry."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "during your conversation with the recruiter, you need to ask the right questions and get clear answers.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}], "text": "Have a conversation with the recruiter."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "When my residency visa will be processed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}], "text": "Ask when your residency visa will be processed."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "So, the next one, how many agents are in one team?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"}], "text": "Ask how many agents are in one team to gauge manager availability."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "And as I said, for the secondary market it's going to be you and your cold calling techniques, but for the offline it should be social media marketing campaigns.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"}], "text": "Ask about the main source of leads in the company."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "And then your question is how many qualified fresh leads each agent will receive in a week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"}], "text": "Inquire about the number of qualified fresh leads each agent will receive weekly."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "during your conversation with the recruiter, you need to ask the right questions and get clear answers.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}], "text": "To ensure a strong start in Dubai real estate, it's recommended to ask certain questions during recruitment."}, "title": "Questions to ask during recruitment", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:37e3e466b287df5c", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Questions to ask during recruitment", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000009"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I'm talking about property monitor or rating which is a databases available for you to learn the market.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000009"}], "text": "Using additional tools like databases can help a real estate consultant rely on data to become successful."}, "title": "Importance of data tools", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:53037e6132c6be85", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Importance of data tools", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So the only real way for you to generate leads is good old cold calling. And you're going to be probably be one of the ten or fifteen agents who call the landlord today.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000011"}], "text": "Cold calling is a primary method for generating leads in the Dubai real estate market, despite challenges like multiple agents contacting the same landlords."}, "title": "Cold calling in real estate", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:251a43b0fdfa49b4", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Cold calling in real estate", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I want to bring up my coaching client example, Ekaterina, who was my top selling agent in 2025. She closed 1,650,000 in her own commission, but the company decided that they want to keep 600,000 out of it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"}], "text": "Ekaterina, a top selling agent, faced a situation where her company attempted to retain part of her commission, which led her to successfully open a court case."}, "title": "Client example - Ekaterina", "topic": "real_estate_example"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:1af1971c966f8a98", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Client example - Ekaterina", "topic": "real_estate_example", "topic_slug": "real_estate_example"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000018"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "For your first deal, the commission could be much bigger. Even if you sell one bedroom, you will pocket eight thousand dollars on average. But the downside is that you may wait three to six months before the commission is actually paid.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000018"}], "text": "Off-plan real estate in Dubai offers potentially higher commissions, but payments can be delayed by three to six months."}, "title": "Off-plan advantages and challenges", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:c169d2718f17b9bb", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Off-plan advantages and challenges", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000019"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "the reality is that even with good campaigns, only twenty to thirty-five percent of leads may be qualified... best closing rate will be one to two percent.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000019"}], "text": "Even with effective campaigns, only twenty to thirty-five percent of off-plan leads may be qualified, resulting in a best closing rate of one to two percent."}, "title": "Lead qualification in Off-plan", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:knowledge:72cd0f173b43cc89", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Lead qualification in Off-plan", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Before all of this conflict, I've told him to wait because it was in the middle of the war.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "The speaker advised Georges to wait because it was in the middle of a war."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "So he started in one of the agencies in my coaching and in three weeks, middle of April, he closed his first off-plan deal.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "Georges started in an agency through the speaker's coaching and closed his first off-plan deal within three weeks."}, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "He told me exactly this. I know I can make it. I see this as an opportunity.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000021"}], "text": "Georges replied that he saw the situation as an opportunity and believed he could succeed."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The story of Georges or Geo as we call him, as you saw my YouTube videos, joined my academy and booked his ticket on March thirtieth. Before all of this conflict, I've told him to wait because it was in the middle of the war.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000020"}], "text": "A Greek client named Georges, nicknamed Geo, saw videos on YouTube, joined the speaker's academy, and booked a ticket during a conflict period."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Coaching client story", "topic": "real_estate_example"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:cases:10d868f8bcbd03d6", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Coaching client story", "topic": "real_estate_example", "topic_slug": "real_estate_example"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Every year thousands of people move to Dubai thinking real estate will change their life. Most of them quit within six months. Not because they are lazy, but because nobody explains what the industry looks like after you land.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker introduces the topic by highlighting the high number of people who move to Dubai for real estate but quit within six months due to lack of preparation."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Introduction on challenges", "topic": "introduction"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:420abe6eeb67a139", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Introduction on challenges", "topic": "introduction", "topic_slug": "introduction"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I call it a Hoover. You may think if they selected me, it means they believe I can make it. So I really have a strong chance, but this is the first illusion.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000002"}], "text": "The speaker refers to the agency hiring system as a 'Hoover', suggesting a mechanism that draws in many candidates with false prospects."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Rhetoric on agency hiring", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:c290b1c304f8b8ed", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Rhetoric on agency hiring", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"], "form": "wording", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "When my residency visa will be processed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000005"}, {"quote": "So, the next one, how many agents are in one team?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000006"}, {"quote": "how many qualified fresh leads each agent will receive in a week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000007"}], "text": "The speaker uses a series of direct questions about key aspects of a real estate job to highlight important considerations for prospective agents."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Persuasive questions", "topic": "real_estate_career"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:821e43f49295b8ab", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Persuasive questions", "topic": "real_estate_career", "topic_slug": "real_estate_career"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "She closed 1,650,000 in her own commission, but the company decided that they want to keep 600,000 out of it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:u000008"}], "text": "The speaker narrates a detailed client case, providing specifics about commission amounts and the legal action taken, to illustrate a point."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Client example format", "topic": "real_estate_example"}, "content_hash": "b61e972ccf77e58e3f390ce5280f5ca737f4a51b328dd63156f761ac6f258e50", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d:expression:19d2a7abe79c24c5", "metadata_hash": "dd07b5a54493b92b6a8f23b68497befa919888d6ec04898910865b3e8de7e2e3", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-16", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "be3c6723582f12d3ce092874fca95e6d17f1cb7989ccf341346a68ea6f0096cc", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-16-dubai-real-estate-career-explained-why-most-agents-fail-sgvl-7f021f4b6d", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgvlxN-0H_Q", "title": "Client example format", "topic": "real_estate_example", "topic_slug": "real_estate_example"}
